Only the write node (sre-rw) proposes the fix for drift: its evidence is kube-mcp's diff of
desired/, a server-side dry run that needs patch, which the read node's ServiceAccount
axlr-sre-read does not have. Decided on 5 November 2026: drift is the first scenario of the `fix`
bot on sre-rw. sre-judge leaves this scenario out of its default run; `--only drift` runs it,
waits for triage's diagnosis, submits a `fix` task with it (standing in for the control plane,
which does not launch the fix phase yet) and scores fix's proposal against expected.md.
